-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This licence applies to the SOURCE CODE of ivanovo2beam only.

Geographic data used or downloaded by this software carries its own licences,
which are NOT superseded by the MIT licence above:

  * OpenStreetMap data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed ODbL 1.0.
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

  * Copernicus DEM (GLO-30/GLO-90) (c) ESA / European Union, Copernicus
    Programme. Free and open under the Copernicus DEM Instrument Licence.

  * ESA WorldCover (c) ESA WorldCover project / contains modified Copernicus
    Sentinel data (2021), licensed CC BY 4.0.

Any geodata this tool derives from OSM (road graphs, footprint tables, lane
assignments, sector geodata) remains a Derivative Database under ODbL 1.0 and
must not be relicensed under MIT. See docs/data_sources.md for the full
obligation list, and build/attribution.json for the machine-readable
provenance manifest of every generated artefact.

No BeamNG.drive game asset is copied, redistributed or relicensed by this
project. Generated levels reference base-game assets by path only.
